Package: razorzip-harness
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mobisec Cloud <razor@mobisec.cloud>
Description: RazorZip open benchmark harness (Core features)
 The open-source benchmark GUI + CLI helpers for the Razor structural
 compression engine. Commercial engine binaries are NOT included: they ship
 only in allow-list-gated packages built by scripts/build-installers.sh.
 Trial requests open the user's own email app, prefilled; nothing is sent
 automatically and no credentials are embedded.
